# Agent behavior

Before coding: state assumptions; if unclear or multi-option, ask — do not pick silently.

While coding:
- Minimum that solves the ask. No speculative abstractions or extra features.
- Touch only what the request requires. Clean up orphans you created; leave unrelated code alone.
- Match nearby style; do not reformat or "improve" adjacent code.

Before done: define success as something runnable (test, build, assertion) and loop until it passes. Do not claim completion without evidence.

Project non-negotiables (details in CLAUDE.md): git worktree for edits; REGRESSION_PLAN.md §0–§1 for protected areas; emoji allowlist only.
